---@field startedEventId aws.swf.EventId The ID of the DecisionTaskStarted event recorded in the history.
---@field workflowExecution aws.swf.WorkflowExecution The workflow execution for which this decision task was created.
---@field workflowType aws.swf.WorkflowType The type of the workflow execution for which this decision task was created.
---@field events aws.swf.HistoryEventList A paginated list of history events of the workflow execution. The decider uses this during the processing of the decision task.
---@field nextPageToken? aws.swf.PageToken If a NextPageToken was returned by a previous call, there are more results available. To retrieve the next page of results, make the call again using the returned token in nextPageToken. Keep all other arguments unchanged.
---@field previousStartedEventId aws.swf.EventId The ID of the DecisionTaskStarted event of the previous decision task of this workflow execution that was processed by the decider. This can be used to determine the events in the history new since the last decision task received by the decider.

